### List genres
GET http://localhost:5000/api/genres?page=1&limit=10

### Search genres
GET http://localhost:5000/api/genres?q=Action

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/genres/genres-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/genres
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Drama",
  "description": "Emotional journeys"
}
